# Improvements

Generally speaking the way we're putting info in the doc is gross.
Maybe having _multiple_ docs for context, then having Grok route to the right one would be a better idea.

The problem is obvious from the current doc - it's got some info about the stream, then some junk about nightreign to help with retrieval, that is dumb, we should have it set up so it only adds the context important for that task

